date-released: 2026-06-14
url: "https://github.com/dragonwang725-design/agi"
abstract: >
  This work formally proves the Necessity of the Receptive Pole Theorem: any generative reasoning system without an independent external factual reading channel (Receptive Pole R = ∅) will structurally produce ungrounded judgments (LLM hallucinations).
  The TDA three-layer dual-perspective dialectical architecture separates the Active Pole (generative reasoning, creativity) and Receptive Pole (independent real-world snapshot loading), supplemented by conflict arbitration and human objective governance layers to reconcile factual determinism and generative capacity.
keywords:
  - LLM hallucination
  - Receptive Pole Theorem
  - TDA architecture
  - Active Pole
  - factual grounding
  - epistemic constraint
  - trustworthy AI
